        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global TH1101 Mortise Lock Body Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCommercial aluminum frame store front door mortise Deadbolt body. Replacement for Adams Rite MS1850  series mortise deadbolts. Accepts standard  <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-cylinder-brass-thumbturn-th1100-bt\">Mortise Thumbturns</a> and <a href=\"/products/1-inch-brass-mortise-cylinder-lock-for-storefront-door-th1100-bc\">Mortise Lock Cylinders</a> with Adams Rite (A/R) cams.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHuge five-ply laminated steel bolt with concealed hardened steel pin provides maximum security. Designed for aluminum or steel framed entry doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in Complete Sets: <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-deadbolt-lock-sets-zinc-cylinders-th1101-pz\"><b>with Zinc Cylinders</b></a>. \r\n<a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-deadbolt-lock-sets-brass-cylinders-th1101-pb\"><b>with Brass Cylinders</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/high-security-storefront-door-mortise-deadbolt-lock-sets-mul-t-lock-cylinders-th1101-pm\"><b>High Security Mul-T-Lock Cylinders</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Global TH1101 Mortise Deadbolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 31/32\",  1-1/8\" or 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Non handed</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate: Width - 1\", Length - 6-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Case Dimensions: Width - 7/8\", Length - 6\", Depth (specific to backset) - 1.63\" through 1.78\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Width - 5/8\", Throw - 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/TH1101.pdf?v=1704262220\" target=\"new\"\"><b>Global TH1101 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li>*Lock Body Only. Does NOT include <a href=\"/products/mortise-deadbolt-faceplate-th1100-fp1-5\"><b>Deadbolt Faceplate</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
